s rise and oil tumbles on U.S.-Iran diplomacy hopes","summary":"Early Monday, Dow futures rose about 310 points (0.6%), S&P 500 futures 0.5% and Nasdaq-100 futures 0.8%. Brent fell about 4.5% to $108.38 and WTI dropped to $99.31 after crude gained more than 10% in October.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/01/stock-market-today-live-updates.html","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n4","cat":"World","title":"Russia resumes attacks on Kherson region after truce ends, Kyiv says","summary":"A local truce brokered by U.S. First Lady Melania Trump, the longest pause in fighting since the full-scale invasion, ended Sunday. Two civilians were wounded in Kherson and one person was killed in Izium.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/russia-resumes-attacks-on-ukraines-kherson-region-after-truce-ends-kyiv-says","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Canada","title":"Poilievre presses Carney for diesel tax cuts ahead of Nov. 5 budget","summary":"The Conservative leader wants diesel taxes ended, GST on fuel suspended and spending cut before Thursday's federal budget. The PBO projects a $63.3-billion deficit for 2026-27.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12129175/conservatives-budget-asks-deficit/","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n6","cat":"World","title":"Spain train crash death toll at 69, victims from 10 countries","summary":"Officials say the Oct. 29 collision near Urda, south of Madrid, killed 54 Spaniards, four Americans and one Canadian among others. A Renfe train hit a stationary Iryo train after a control centre let it resume.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/one-czech-national-and-four-us-citizens-among-spain-train-crash-dead-officials-say","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Business","title":"Binance reopens withdrawals after $6B+ hack blamed on North Korea","summary":"Users pulled about $4.7 billion on Sunday after the hack drained more than $6 billion. The FBI blamed North Korea's TraderTraitor group; Binance says it has replaced 90% of stolen assets with company funds.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/binance-resumes-withdrawals-after-billions-stolen-in-hack","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Business","title":"Apple reports tonight in new CEO John Ternus's first earnings test","summary":"Analysts expect revenue up nearly 11% to about $113.4 billion and net profit of about $29 billion. Investors will watch holiday guidance, memory-chip costs and AI plans.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/apples-new-ceo-faces-earnings-test-as-rising-chip-costs-cloud-outlook","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n9","cat":"World","title":"Bulgaria's acting president Yotova wins presidential runoff","summary":"Initial estimates gave Iliana Yotova about 57-58% of the vote. Opponent Andrey Gyurov, backed by the pro-Western opposition, took about 39% and conceded.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/01/bulgarias-acting-president-yotova-leads-in-exit-polls-of-runoff-election","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n10","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney says Canada and U.S. will work toward trade deal in coming weeks","summary":"After speaking with Trump, Carney said both sides will pursue a mutually beneficial deal. Talks collapsed in August and 50% U.S. tariffs remain; no deal is expected before the midterms.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12129201/mark-carney-us-trade-deal-talks-ongoing/","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"Belgian PM De Wever offers resignation after budget talks fail","summary":"King Philippe is weighing the offer and consulting coalition leaders after overnight budget negotiations collapsed. New elections would follow if the resignation is accepted.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/belgiums-pm-bart-de-wever-to-offer-resignation-to-king-after-overnight-budget-talks-fail","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n12","cat":"AI","title":"Abu Dhabi signs series of OpenAI deals for government services","summary":"Agreements cover government services, investment analysis with Mubadala, food safety and education, following a meeting with Sam Altman. A food-import pilot is already running.","source":"The National","url":"https://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/11/02/abu-dhabi-agrees-openai-deals-to-boost-government-services-and-education","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Major","title":"Nine killed as Learjet crashes in Palm Beach County, Florida","summary":"A Learjet 60 flying from Austin to the Bahamas crashed Sunday in a residential area about 11 km from Mar-a-Lago, killing all nine aboard. The FAA and NTSB are investigating.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/all-nine-on-board-learjet-killed-in-florida-plane-crash-near-trumps-resort-home","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney calls six federal byelections for Dec. 7","summary":"Votes will be held in two Ontario ridings, three in Quebec and Yorkton-Melville in Saskatchewan.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12129143/canada-byelections-december-2026/","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n15","cat":"AI","title":"South Korea's 2027 budget puts 21.3 trillion won into chips, data centres and AI","summary":"President Lee urged passage of an 820.9-trillion-won ($614.5B) budget, up 12.8%. It includes 4.6 trillion won for a sovereign AI model.","source":"Korea Herald","url":"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10922482","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n16","cat":"AI","title":"UK sovereign fund joins Fractile's ~$700M round at $6.5B valuation","summary":"The London inference-chip startup's valuation jumped from about $1 billion earlier this year. The UK's taxpayer-backed Sovereign AI Fund is participating.","source":"Dealroom","url":"https://dealroom.co/news/168114-uk-taxpayers-buy-into-the-ai-chip-boom-as-the-sovereign-ai-fund-joins-fractile-s-6-5bn-round","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI may rebrand data centres as 'AI compute campuses'","summary":"Citing Axios, TechCrunch reports the rebrand is part of a PR push planned for after the U.S. midterm elections, amid local opposition to data centres.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/01/openai-might-rebrand-its-data-centers-as-ai-compute-campuses/","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Major","title":"Kimi Antonelli, 20, becomes F1's youngest world champion","summary":"The Mercedes driver clinched the title by finishing third at the Mexico City Grand Prix, won by Max Verstappen ahead of Lewis Hamilton.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/kimi-antonelli-becomes-youngest-f1-champion-as-max-verstappen-wins-race","published":"2026-11-02"},{"id":"n19","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa stops short of endorsing EU carbon border tax as energy ties deepen","summary":"Environment Minister Julia Dabrusin defended industrial carbon pricing but is seeking an arrangement to ease the EU levy's burden on Canadian exporters, following last week's Montreal summit.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/canadian-minister-stops-short-of-endorsing-eu-carbon-tax-as-energy-alliance-deepens","published":"2026-11-02"}]}